  <h1>How to read a Haskell type signature</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>By Coldwast</span><span>Updated Aug 12, 2026</span><span>8 min read</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#types</span><span class="tag">#beginners</span></div>
  <nav class="toc" id="toc"></nav>
  <figure>
    <img class="hero" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/4458203/pexels-photo-4458203.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940" alt="A blue-toned architectural drawing photographed at a shallow angle, its cover sheet lettered in white with the Russian words for architectural drawings above a dimensioned floor plan" width="940" height="627" loading="eager" />
